:* {{IPA|de|/ˈmɔr.mɛt/|[ˈmɔɐ̯mɛt]|[ˈmɔːmɛt]}} {{i|sometimes in casual speech}}

===Proper noun===
{{head|de|proper noun|g=m}}

# [[Muhammad]] {{gloss|the prophet of Islam}}
